epicts a serene van interior overlooking a stunning beach with warm sunlight, vibrant flowers, and soft bedding. The composition is visually appealing and cohesive, with the light uniformly highlighting the van's cozy interior and the picturesque seaside view."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 199, "label": "text", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "id": 81, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "aac13aa7ce35b07d43633c3bbe654a38c00d74f5", "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 26}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [140, 246.00006103515625], "pos": [1720, 1060], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 135, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "flags": {}, "id": 88, "type": "PreviewImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.43", "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 25}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [1290, 1650], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [2126.98046875, 634.039306640625], "widgets_values": ["", "comfyui", "second", "png", 80, false, "", false, true], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 201, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "flags": {}, "id": 90, "type": "LayerUtility: SaveImagePlus", "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_LayerStyle_Advance", "ver": "0f9184100e626e3202568a7cf890b3b92685a168", "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: SaveImagePlus"}, "order": 36}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [230, 258], "pos": [-980, 540], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 193, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "flags": {}, "id": 96, "type": "PreviewImage", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.43", "Node name for S&R": "PreviewImage"}, "order": 22}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [173], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["You are a prompt translator for single-image editing tasks using the Kontext format with the Flux model.\n\nYour role is to convert a user's natural language editing instruction into a clean, precise image editing directive.\n\nYou will receive:\n- A single image as input\n- One sentence from the user describing the change they want\n\nFollow these strict guidelines:\n\n1. Assume the model already sees the original image. **Do not describe what’s already in the image.**\n   - ❌ Avoid: “The image shows…”, “There is…”, “The original scene contains…”\n   - ✅ Only focus on what needs to be changed, and what should stay exactly the same\n\n2. Write the editing instruction using **precise visual language**, using verbs like:\n   - “replace”, “add”, “remove”, “insert”, “transform into”\n\n3. Always clearly state what must remain unchanged, such as:\n   - Subject’s appearance, pose, lighting, expression, texture, proportion, shadow\n\n4. If the instruction includes style or background changes:\n   - Describe the new elements with specific visual characteristics (e.g., “soft shadows on sand”, “clear sky with sun”)\n   - Ensure lighting direction, scale, and realism are consistent with the original image\n\n5. Output **one clear English paragraph** that:\n   - States the change\n   - States the constraints\n   - Emphasizes realistic visual integration\n\n6. Do not include artistic framing, stylized mockups, or advertising-like renderings unless explicitly requested.\n\n---\n\nInsert the user instruction below where indicated:\n\nINSTRUCTION TO TRANSLATE:\n{{PROMPT}}\n\nRespond with one clean, final editing instruction paragraph only, following the rules above.\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "LayerUtility: TextBox", "title": "System Prompt", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [500, 660], "pos": [-1540, -240], "id": 99, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_layerstyle", "ver": "3bfe8e435d167b4a5bf08716729f89802dbbaa6f", "Node name for S&R": "LayerUtility: TextBox"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name":